window.products.push({"id":632025,"name":"MRbrew Gas Manifold, CO2 Gas Distributor, 5/16'' Barb Fitting Beer Kegerator Splitter, 2-Way Air Distributor with Integrated Check Valves & Hose Clamp","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61loTlUfQrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【LOW COST CONNECTING EXTENSION】The gas manifold is designed with two 5/16’’ barb fitting outputs, which allows splitting co2 gas line from 1 output to 2 outputs to brewing keg, no need of high cost multi-connection regulator! 【ANTI-BACKFLOW & EXCELLENT SEALING】This CO2 Distributor has a shut off valve on 2 outputs individually, can control each outputs individually. Each output has a built-in check valve, which will not get backflow into the gas line if hooking up an over- or under-pressurized keg. The sealant is strong on the connection to prevent leaks perfectly. 【QUALITY ANTI-RUST MATERIAL】The beer kegerator splitter is seriously assembled with excellent quality parts and has great quality control. It is made of quality aluminum, which is strongly against rust and corrosion, easy to clean and will last for long. 【INDISPENSABLE TOOL TO BUILD A STRONG KEG SYSTEM】This air distributor can let you carbonate 2 kegs at the exact same pressure setting with a regulator. But it can not carbonate different beers simultaneously that require different carbonation pressures setting! 【100% LIFELONG ISSUES SOLVING FOR YOU】Each MRbrew co2 manifold is backed by unbeatable, reliable, trusted product quality, we will unconditionally solve your problems if you are not satisfied!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61loTlUfQrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MRbrew","source_asin":"B09G9RTTXZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-632025","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09G9RTTXZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09G9RTTXZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
