window.products.push({"id":632102,"name":"Clever sprouts Anti Barking Device, Sonic Bark Deterrents, Ultrasonic Bark Control, Waterproof,Outdoor use, Hidden Anti-Barking Device Pet Trainer, Ba","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kcmWXdORL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[ Description ] 1. This anti barking device was built to offer pet owners more professional ways to train their pets. 2. It is powered by a 9-volt battery replaceable battery which you insert into the unit. With the aid of an internal microphone which picks up dog bark, Outdoor Bark Control is automatically activated when it detects barks up to 50 feet away. It then emits ultrasonic sound. 3. On hearing this high-pitched sound, the dog immediately stops barking as it will associate its bark with this unpleasant noise. When the dog stops barking the ultrasonic sound also stops. 4. The new outdoor bark control has 4 range levels including a test mode. It has 2 LED to indicate good or bad battery. 5. The New Outdoor Bark Control comes in a beautiful, well-designed birdhouse unit. [ Features ] 1. Defer noisy barking by harmless ultrasonic sound 2. Range up to 50 feet 3. Four adjustable ultrasonic volume levels(including a test mode). Test-used to verify the microphone and speaker are functional. Low Range-up to 15 feet/5 meters (Suggest testing indoors). Medium Range-up to 30 feet/10 meters. High Range-up to 50 feet/15 meters 4. Dural and weatherproof for outdoor use 5. LED light flashes for low battery indication 6. 9V Battery operation - (battery not included)7. Dimension: 6.1×5.5×6.1in, N.W. 0.6Lb, G.W. 1Lb [ Package Includes ] New Outdoor Bark Control (battery not included) and manual [ Caution ] Keep at one-arm-length away from the human ear(s) to avoid hearing damage if a dog begins barking while you are setting up, mounting or hanging the New Bark Control.device [ Note ] If the dog is deaf or hearing impaired, he may not react to the Outdoor Bark Control You can hang it outside your house to chase away agitated cicadas or bird sounds","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kcmWXdORL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Clever sprouts","source_asin":"B01LMEGQD2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-632102","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LMEGQD2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LMEGQD2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
