window.products.push({"id":632161,"name":"Pickle and Olive Hourglass Jar, Pickle Jar with Strainer Flip,Juice Separator, Kimchi Pickles Olives Container Airtight Hourglass Jar","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512lALsFFjL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Description:This pickle jar is 2-in-1 storage and serving solution. hourglass-shaped jar stores pickles and olive in their juices until you flip to strain for serving.Features:1. We created wet and dry hourglass jars that separate the liquid from the food when serving, and keep the food not being soaked.2. Made of BPA free polypropylene and high-quality silicone lid, food-grade material, non-toxic and safe. Heat-resistant, corrosion-resistant, not easily deformed and damaged.3. Just flip it over to easily switch between dry and wet food, not just for pickled cucumbers. Also great for storing different types of pickles, or for salad mixes, olive, black cherries.Specification:Product Name: Pickle JarMaterial: PP + SiliconeSize: about 11*11*13cm / 4.35*4.35*5.14inPacking List:1 * Pickle Jar","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512lALsFFjL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KRONDO","source_asin":"B0B1516QC4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-632161","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1516QC4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1516QC4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":632162,"name":"Moving Bags Heavy Duty Extra Large W/Backpack Straps & Zippers,Packing Bags for Moving,Storage Totes for Space Saving,Extra Large Moving Bag Compatibl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710C6AqSyaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌈【DURABLE & HEAVY DUTY】 – As one of the most durable heavy duty moving bags available, the Moucas storage bags for moving is unmatched in its quality. With a 160 GSM thickness, the blue bags for moving are waterproof and rip resistant, and can hold up to 45-50lbs of weight for moving or storage purposes. 🌈【TEAR RESISTANT REINFORCED HANDLE】 – The heavy-duty handle is made of sturdy woven material, and the extended handle design greatly enhances the load-bearing capacity to avoid the risk of accidental breakage; the link between the handle and the heavy duty storage bags is made of 3 layers of durable fabric spacers and reinforced cross-shaped stitching, further eliminating accidental conditions such as the bag strap falling off and the bag body tearing when carrying heavy items. 🌈【REINFORCED HARDWARE & DOUBLE STITCHES】 – We are constantly updating the quality of our products based on feedback from our customers. For easy and firm opening and closing, we use high-quality zippers with dual heads and place the zipper on one side of the moving bags for clothes to make it easy to load. On places that could easily tear, we use double stitching and reinforced seam line stitching technology, which largely improves the possibility of load-bearing. 🌈【86L CAPACITY FOR ALL YOUR ITEMS】 – With an extra large size of 29\" x 15\" x 13\", this moving storage bags has enough space to hold up to 23 gallons and is ideal for college dorms, closets, attics, basements, bedrooms, warehouses, laundry rooms, and garages, among other places. Bedding, sheets, pillows, and linen can all be stored in reusable moving boxes that are water resistant and allow you to store both large and tiny items. 🌈【WIDELY USED FOR MOVING & STORAGE】 – These Heavy Duty Extra Large Moving Bags are great for storing a various stuffs from clothing, shoes and supplies to bedding and even Christmas decorations! Traveling with additional items that won't fit in your luggage? These blue moving bags with handles are excellent for you. If you're transferring to a new college dorm or school, these moving totes will make the process much easier. Just unclutter and arrange your belongings with this simple method.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710C6AqSyaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Moucas","source_asin":"B0BNMKPS8N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-632162","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNMKPS8N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNMKPS8N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
