window.products.push({"id":632226,"name":"HOMEASY Ice for Whiskey Cocktails, Food Grade 304 Stainless Steel Ice Cube Reusable for Drinks, Whiskey Stones Drinks Cooler Gift Set with Ice Tongs S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZZnypXYIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Food Grade 304 Stainless Steel Ice Cube Reusable for Drinks - They have a high quality appearance and are neatly made. Even after months and frequent use, there are no signs of wear and tear. WILL NOT Water Down Drinks - In contrast to traditional ice cubes, the stainless steel ice for whiskey cocktails will not water down drinks, and also keep them cool longer than cubes made of soapstone and do not leave any residue in the drink or on the glass. Comes with Ice Tongs and Freezer Storage Tray - Easy To Use. The whiskey ice cubes stones are stored in the freezer for two to four hours. For the best whiskey experience, it is recommended to put 3pcs stones in the glass at a time , this creates the full-bodied aroma development without loss of taste. Better Cooling Performance - The reusable cocktail ice are filled with a cooling gel made of ethanol. Which contribute to a significantly better cooling performance, as the gel stores the cold better. IDEAL GIFT SET - The drinks cooler set is an ideal gift idea for all lovers of good drinks such as Whiskey, Vodka, Wine, Beer, Cocktails.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZZnypXYIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"homeasy","source_asin":"B094JLDZYB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-632226","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B094JLDZYB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B094JLDZYB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":632227,"name":"Barnwood Decor of OKC | Old Farmhouse 4' Tall Primitive Barnwood Display Ladder Authentic Weathered Wood (White Wash)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61KkBZwJwoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Made from 100% authentic weathered wood, this rustic barn wood ladder is made from old 1x4s. At 4 feet tall, this ladder has 4 rungs, with a space 11.5 inches wide and 9.5 inches tall between each rung. This lovely piece is perfect for indoor or outdoor use- add lights, garland or greenery, or use the rungs as shelves to display photos. Perfect for stand-alone or to hang on a wall, vertically, or horizontally. Extremely primitive- the wood is not new!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61KkBZwJwoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Barnwood Decor of OKC","source_asin":"B07HYBLHFY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-632227","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HYBLHFY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HYBLHFY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":632228,"name":"Modern Home Set of 2 Manhattan Contemporary Adjustable Barstool - Vanilla White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51kHVxhCTTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Set of 2! the cool Manhattan has an ergonomically contoured seat made from ABS resin with a high gloss finish. The slender stem and round base are made from chrome plated steel, with a hand crafted footrest at the Bottom of the stem. The stool comes with a variable Height gas lift and 360 degree swivel mechanism. There is also a protective rubber ring beneath the base to protect the floor. The Manhattan uses its contemporary design to bring a fresh feel to the atmosphere. The uniquely cut seat and high gloss finish make it an eye-catching item of furniture that is bound to turn more than a few heads. Perfect in either a new age kitchen with or for use in a modern bar, the Manhattan has an unmistakable character that translates to its surroundings. It is also suitable in other areas either in a child's bedroom or in a conservatory where the light will bring out the contoured surface and the chrome of the stem and base. Each barstool comes complete with an adjustable gas lift tested to operate at least 100,000 times! measures 16.5\" wide by 16\" deep and adjusts from table to counter/bar Height (25\" to 33.25\" overall Height). the seat Height adjusts from 22\" to 30.25\". the footrest measures 12\" wide. The base has a 15.75\" diameter. The backrest rises 4\" above the seat. We have the best quality barstools of this type. Don't settle for a cheap imitation made of inferior materials. We are so confident in the durability of our product that we offer a 5 year warranty on the strut performance on all our barstools that we sell.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51kHVxhCTTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Modern Home","source_asin":"B00O942EOI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-632228","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00O942EOI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00O942EOI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":632229,"name":"Lmtime Toilet Bath Mat U-Shaped, Soft and Comfortable, Super Water Absorption, Non-Slip, Thick, Machine Wash and Easier to Dry for Bathroom Commode Co","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dO1SILt7L._AC_UL1000_.jpg","description":"Hand Wash Only Non-Slip U Shaped Bath Mats - Non slip bottom features high quality mesh material to prevent the mat from shifting and skidding, protecting you and family from any slipping in the bathroom. WARNING: Place mat on CLEAN DRY FLAT FLOOR ONLY. Water under rug can cause it to slip. Always keep bottom of rug dry Suitable for bathroom, sink, kitchen, laundry room, living room, bedroom, porch, etc. Soft & Warm - our bath mat for home is constructed with thousands of individual polyester shags, sink your toes into the comfortable contentment of a bathtoom floor mat from threshold. Soft pile that soothes tired foot and shields toes from the cold floor. Ultra Absorbent - Bathroom mats are made of thousands of ultra-soft individual microfiber shags. The thick chenille fabric absorbs water quickly to help save your floors from dripping water while you're getting out of the bath, shower or getting ready by the sink; Moisture is trapped in the mat's 1.16'' deep piles, allowing the bath rug to dry quickly and cleanly MACHINE WASHABLE/DRYABLE: Machine washing or Hand washing allowed. Simply put this kitchen rug into your Washing Machine ,Cold Wash , Gentle Cycle,then Dry it in Air. This durable materials and high-quality construction ensure that it will not deteriorate, flatten or fall apart with use. This non slip bath mat will hold up for years and its color will stay nice and vibrant no matter how frequently they’ll be washed and dried! SOFT TOUCH * VERSATILITY: Size: 40*60cm/15.7*23.6\".Our bathroom mats with size 20”x 30” is widely used for bathroom, bedroom,living room,kitchen, vanity & guest suite etc. If you have any questions during the shopping process, please feel free to contact us, we will solve it for you within 24 hours","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dO1SILt7L._AC_UL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lmtime","source_asin":"B084RFWT5B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-632229","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084RFWT5B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084RFWT5B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
