window.products.push({"id":632311,"name":"JCFKSDJ Glass Olive Oil Dispenser Bottle With Silicone Oil Brush 2 In 1 Oil Dispenser Bottle Silicone Dropper Measuring for Kitchen Air Fryer BBQ Panc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61a6WXpigFL._AC_SL1111_.jpg","description":"PP+silicone+glass 【NOVEL UNIQUE 2 IN 1 DESIGN】DOCTOR'S SUGGESTION: Precise daily control of olive oil intake can effectively alleviate and prevent obesity. 2 in 1 design glass olive oil dispenser bottle silicone dripper and brush can make you apply it precision pouring and anointing,get less oil consumption and healthier eating. Oil dispenser bottle with silicone brush 2 In 1 , wide caliber design and large capacity(6 Oz ). 【SQUEEZE BRUSH BASTER】Glass bottle and cap with silicone brush, each part can be disassembled and cleaned separately, glass olive oil bottle brush can be used alone, with measurement marks, ust a slight pinch, you can quickly enter the oil, and the precise scale allows you to control the quantitative oil output, the return hole design to avoid the waste and overflow of oil, make the desktop more tidy. 【EASY TO USE】Glass olive oil dispenser bottle with brush mouth itself is large, so you can easily pour oil, vinegar, chili oil, etc. The operation of bottle oil mister is very simple, just gently press the top, inhale the liquid according to the pressure size, put it into the required cooking food, and apply it evenly with the silicone brush head to make the food more delicious.Glass oil bottles are reusable to meet your kitchen needs. 【FOOD GRADE MATERIAL】Glass olive oil bottles for kitchen. The silicone dropper and brush are made of food-grade PP. Can direct contact with food, health and safety, bottle body using borosilicate glass handmade,oil brush material for silicone, soft and flexible texture, resist high temperature up to 250 degrees celsius, not shed hair, BPA free, durable and eco-friendly. 【MULTIPURPOSE USE】Glass oil bottles for kitchen are very widely used, can contain olive oil, avocado oil, coconut oil, melted butter, vinegar, juice, honey, Chili oil, vinegar, and soy sauce. You can easily basting meat or fish when fried with pan, or use for grillings long time without taking oil frequently. Best oil basting brush with dispenser bottle for baking or cooking without dealing with the messy drips. Get less oil consumption and healthier eating.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61a6WXpigFL._AC_SL1111_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JCFKSDJ","source_asin":"B09X4F9SWK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-632311","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09X4F9SWK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09X4F9SWK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":632312,"name":"GardenBasix Soil Moisture Meter Watering Alarm Chirping Bird Plant Water Tester Hygrometer Sensor Gardening Tool Kit for Planter Water Remind Warining","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pnPGCmi8S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"1. Most potted plant deaths are caused by water shortage or excessive watering. This lovely soil humidity sensor will whistle when the soil is short of water to remind you to water the plants. So you don't have to water plants too much for fear of water shortage. 2. Don't bother to look at the numbers on various indicators, just water them when they call, and make your life easier. 3. Cute design can be used as an ornament for flowerpots to make your garden more beautiful. 4. It's very simple to use. Just pull out the plastic sheet at the bottom and it will start to work. When you just insert it into the soil, it will make the calls of birds or frogs, but once moisture is detected in the soil, it will stop singing. 5. The standard size button battery can last for one year. At the same time, there is a light sensor at the bottom of the product, which will stop working at night to avoid disturbing your rest.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pnPGCmi8S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GardenBasix","source_asin":"B07RRJJH5K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-632312","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RRJJH5K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RRJJH5K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":632313,"name":"Mora Ceramics Tea Cup with Loose Leaf Infuser, Spoon and Lid, 12 oz, Microwave and Dishwasher Safe Coffee Mug - Rustic Matte Ceramic Glaze, Modern Her","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SMOymJjOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"IT’S TIME TO HIT PAUSE: Mora Ceramics is more than a mug. Mora is Latin for \"Pause\", acting as a reminder to slow down in your amazing life. You are always being told to do more, to go faster, to be better, but it's time for you to slow down every once in a while and hit pause. Your Mora mug can help you do that. Every time you use a Mora tea mug it is a reminder to hit pause, give yourself some me time, and improve your overall well-being. LEAD FREE ALL NATURAL GLAZE: We know that lead is a poison, but what some of us don't know is that it is in a lot of ceramic glazes, since there is no US regulation for lead in adult products. Unlike other ceramic companies, our glazes are lead free, meaning you will never have to worry about lead leaching into your system and making you sick. TITANIUM COATED TEA FILTER AND SPOON: Our stainless steel tea infuser and spoon are coated with titanium for an anti-erosion finish. Instead of using chemical plating, we use a pressurized vacuum-coating so there are zero chemicals used in the process. Please note that vacuum-coating may result in the inside part of the infuser not having as bright of a copper color as the outside, since it is pressurized from the outside wall-in. All our materials are food grade, beautiful, and lightweight. MULTI FUNCTIONING CERAMIC LID: Our lid will not only keep your tea or coffee hot, but will also act as a coaster to hold the infuser when you are finished steeping. Covering your tea seals in heat, creates a full extraction and insures the essential oils of the herbs stay in your cup. MORA’S 30 DAY PROMISE: Love your Mora mug or return it for a 100% refund, no questions asked. Our customer service is available daily to hear your questions or concerns. Our objective is to help you hit pause, so we won’t settle for anything you don’t love. We’re not happy unless you are.❤","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SMOymJjOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MORA CERAMICS HIT PAUSE","source_asin":"B08F5C6JW3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-632313","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08F5C6JW3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08F5C6JW3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
