window.products.push({"id":632325,"name":"Kitchen Scissors - Stainless Steel Utility Shears, Multi-Purpose cooking Scissors for Chicken, Poultry,Fish, Herbs,Meat, Bones, by Nicefeel (24 cm/9.5","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51u31leGGDL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Precision Performance Blades These poultry shears feature curved blades that are designed to leave you with a clean, precise cut every time. You'll have no problems reaching those awkward spaces, which is great if you're cutting whole chicken and turkey into portions. And because you can achieve a really efficient cut, you’ll waste less meat too. Made of stainless steel for maximum strength and durability, these blades also make light work of small bones. Don't worry about them slipping as you apply pressure. Their serrated edges grip bones and skin to prevent movement - for safe, secure cutting. The blades are corrosion and stain resistant too, so with proper care you can rely on them to provide outstanding performance over and over again. Soft Grip and Non-Slip for Comfortable Cutting It doesn't matter whether you're jointing a whole duck, or trimming the fat from a steak. With these heavy duty poultry shears, you can always cut in complete comfort. Their handles are coated with a soft, non-slip grip, which means you can maintain a tight hold as you cut. The handles also include a spring-loaded mechanism, which further reduces the strain on your hands. Spring-Loaded Safety Lock for Safer Storage When you've finished, you can safely store these poultry shears in your utensils drawer. Just close the blades and push down the spring-loaded safety catch. Easy. Customer Service: If you have any questions about our products, you can send us an email by clicking the \"Seller Contact\" button in your Amazon account. We are happy to assist you and we will get back to you as soon as possible.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51u31leGGDL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aboden","source_asin":"B07YFSQGTH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-632325","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YFSQGTH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YFSQGTH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
