window.products.push({"id":632480,"name":"MIU France Stainless Steel Potato Ricer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4110X4NYZEL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Stainless Steel Jumbo Potato Ricer Amazon.com The way to perfect mashed potatoes is through a ricer, the most basic form of which is the potato press. The reason it's so good to mash potatoes this way, is that it breaks down lumps that a hand-held masher might miss with the least amount of effort. Overworking cooked potatoes--by using a food processor, for instance--can break down starch molecules and result in gooey rather than smooth, fluffy mashed potatoes. The MIU France stainless steel potato presser works just like a large garlic press. Two hinged handles, when compressed, push a plunger down into a cylindrical hopper; the riced potato is then extruded out the bottom of the press. (It's called ricing because the pressed potato resembles grains of rice, at least until it gets mashed.) The bottom handles comfortably-spaced finger indentations provide a strong grip while pressing. This tool is also well-suited for pureeing fruits and vegetables for soups, desserts, preserves, or homemade baby foods. The MIU France potato presser is made of 18/10 stainless steel--brushed on the inside with a high-gloss, chrome-like polish on the outside. The presser is dishwasher-safe. However, when washing by hand, avoid harsh abrasive scrubbers or cleansers in order to preserve the polished finish. The presser measures 11 by 4 by 4 inches, including handles. --Garland Withers","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4110X4NYZEL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MIU France","source_asin":"B0000DZCY7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-632480","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000DZCY7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000DZCY7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":632481,"name":"Ultimate Textile Reversible Shantung Satin - Majestic 72-Inch Round Tablecloth Ivory Cream","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.17,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VS0AhbkOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Majestic reversible shantung satin tablecloths offer one side faux dupioni and the other side shiny satin. Wrinkle and stain resistant, they feature a seamless design with serged edges. Because these fabric table cloths are made of durable polyester, they are machine washable and can be used countless times. Reversible with one side faux dupioni and the other side satin, there is value in the multi-use potential. The Ivory 70 Inch Round Majestic Tablecloths are an excellent choice for your wedding, party, home dining, Christmas and Thanksgiving dinners and other special events. Due to variations in computer monitors, colors shades may vary in appearance from screen to screen. The number of pieces per pack is equal to the pack name. Please search Ultimate Textile for matching and complementary items in all shapes and sizes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VS0AhbkOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ultimate Textile","source_asin":"B07JN3GMG2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-632481","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JN3GMG2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JN3GMG2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
