window.products.push({"id":632590,"name":"Bluapple Classic Produce Saver 15-Month Bundle, Vegetable & Fruit Fresh Produce Protector, Ethylene Gas Absorber, Food Freshness Extender, Fresh Fruit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91BeRzsNOsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"STAY FRESH: The 15-Month Bundle comes with a Bluapple Classic Produce Saver 2-Pack and a One-Year Refill Kit. You will receive two (2) Classic Bluapples and ten (10) active ingredient packets. Extend the life of your nutritious produce by absorbing ethylene gas, which slows down the ripening process. Our ethylene gas absorber helps to keep your food fresher longer. LONG-LASTING PACKETS: Classic Bluapple refill packets contain volcanic rock combined with a sodium compound which works to absorb and neutralize ethylene gas. Simply replace each packet every three (3) months to retain optimal freshness. EASY TO USE: Our Bluapple fresh fruit preserver and veggie saver can be safely used in refrigerators and produce drawers. This helps to reduce spoilage by slowing the aging process. Keep foods fresh and nutritious longer outside the fridge by placing the Bluapple inside a fruit bowl with your favorite raw foods that don't require refrigeration. MADE IN THE USA: At Bluapple, we pride ourselves on being the experts in keeping produce fresh. Made right here in the USA, our refill packets help your produce last up to two (2) to three (3) times longer, leaving you more time to enjoy your fruits and vegetables. Plus, instead of throwing out an old packet, you can put it in your garden to help your home-grown fruits and vegetables. BECAUSE WE CARE: Our vision is to provide an effective way to reduce food waste and preserve your shopping budget. Bluapple works hard to bring you reliable products that can improve your life. In addition to the Bluapple Classic Produce Saver, try our other products that help keep your produce fresh longer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91BeRzsNOsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BluApple","source_asin":"B07HKP76ML","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-632590","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HKP76ML","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HKP76ML","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
