window.products.push({"id":632686,"name":"Goodes Glass Wax Melt Warmer Electric Wax Melt Warmer Wax 3D Burner Melter Fragrance Warmer Night Light for Home, Bedroom, Living Room, Office, Gifts ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zjCf7WVDS._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"Night Light Function: The Wax Warmer Makes Is Excellent For Brightening Your Room, Nursery Or Living Room. It Provides Light To Keep Your Room Bright Enough For You To Sleep Without Discomfort. Energy Efficiency: It Is Perfect For People Who Are Looking For Newer Ways To Make Their Homes Energy-Efficient. It Comes With Two Bulb Of About 25W. It Works With Tart, Fragrant Oil And Wax Cubes.  And it Also Melts Wax Tart, And Essential Oils And Emits The Fragrance In Your Home Eliminating Every Unpleasant Smell Including Tobacco, Wet Rugs, Garbage, Etc. Safe And Easy To Use: The Simplicity Ensures Anyone Can Use This Wax Warmer. All You Need To Do Is Plug It In And Turn It On. There Is No Environmental Risk Attached To Using This Wax Warmer In Your Home. Instruction: ★1.Put the essential oil or wax tarts into the glass cover ★2.Plug in power supply, when the glass cover hot, the essential oil or wax tarts will fragrance fills your room ★3. Pull out the power and waiting for the glass to cooling before touching the lamp Notice: ★1. When electric wax burner is working, please do not touch the lamp in case of scald, because the glass and lampshade will be heats. ★2. Please place the product where your children or pets cannot easily touch to avoid the accidents. ★3. Don't touch the glass lid or the glass sides until several hours after turning it off. Specifications: ★Material: Handmade Glass ★Product Size:6x5 Inches ★Color: While ★Weight: 1.7 lb Packing: ★1 x Glass Electric Candle Warmer ★1 x Glass Dish ★2 x Bulbs ★1 x User Manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zjCf7WVDS._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Goodes","source_asin":"B08XVRJXGV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-632686","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XVRJXGV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XVRJXGV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":632687,"name":"TUAN 31 Inch Electric Fireplace, Recessed and Wall Mounted Fireplace, Fireplace Heater and Linear Fireplace with Timer, Touch Panel and Remote Control","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":148.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61otHG8WFiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"➤【Well Made & Beautiful Home Decor】: Slim design with sturdy sturcture and flat tempered glass front panel, TUAN electric fireplace adds pretty realistic flames and awesome heat out put to any room. A bit more homey and interesting to your room, it is the excellent choice, whether you want it for aesthetic or heat purposes. ➤【Multi Interesting Functions 】: Equipped Button panal and remote control,Upgrade 12 flame & LED flame bed color modes, Besides, the fireplace has a cycle mode that automatically changes the color of the flame and bed every 10 seconds,Meet your various daily needs. ➤【Realistic 12 Colorful Flame】: Ultra High Intensity Led lights with large display allows the flame to \"burn\" high enough, flames emerge slowly from the \"source\" and then get pulled to the top of the fireplace where they flash in the heat of the top of the fireplace.12-color flame and crystal combination change creat an incredibly realistic & colorful effects . ➤【Warm & Comfort 】: The heat comes out the middle of the upper part of the front, which concentrate more heat and make it warmer, Temperature settings from 62°F to 82°F and timer from 0.5H to 9H adjustable, It puts out enough heat and makes the room so cozy, SUITABLE FOR ABOUT 400 SQ FT SPACE. ➤【Safety and Energy Saving】: Our fireplace has 750W & 1500W two modes can be adjusted accordingly for both warm and energy saving purpose. The supplemental zone heating is for up to 400 square feet. CSA & ETL Certificate Approved. It also has auto-heat kill safety to avoid the overheating. The heat is good for maintaining the natural humidity within the air without making the room too dry. ➤【What You Will Get】: 31.8L*16.7W*5.6D; Package including -1x electric fireplace, 1x remote control, 1x installation manual, 1x bracket and hardware accessories. We provide a 2-year warranty, if you have any issues, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61otHG8WFiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TUAN","source_asin":"B0BZD8G5H8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-632687","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZD8G5H8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZD8G5H8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
