window.products.push({"id":632803,"name":"SUPERIOR Hand Woven Indoor Area Rug, Natural Jute, Vintage Boho Floor Decor for Living/Dining Room, Bedroom, Office, Dorm, Kitchen, Entryway, Farmhous","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":96.4,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81awd-GeoSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Affordable Luxury Rugs Superior is excited to offer the all-natural, reversible, Braided Jute area rug. Constructed of 100% natural jute fibers, they offer inherent natural beauty to your space. The rug blends very well with many types of decor with its tan color, adding a harmonious setting to the room. The classic braided pattern imparts an outstanding design to enhance the décor of any room. Both sides of the rug are useable for double the wear. The Braided jute rugs are hand woven with natural fibers to create a firm and durable rug that can endure low, medium or high traffic areas in your home. The earthy texture contributes to a relaxed, informal vibe to a space. Blissfully beautiful in its original buff color, our braided jute rugs are available in various sizes and are kept un-dyed to bring out its natural essence. Casual yet polished appeal encourages for a variety of decorating genres. The thick jute fibers are intertwined securely for a textured feel and get softer after continued usage while maintaining a calm and organic ambiance. This 0.75-inches dense, tight weave, neutral-colored area rug will coordinate with new or existing contemporary, modern, coastal or unique farmhouse decor. The rug border is also woven securely with jute fabric gives it a strength it needs to preserve the longevity and heavily frequented rooms. Easy to clean, vacuum regularly. Blot spills and stains with a clean cloth. With over 200 designs, Superior offers a wide range of prints and sizes to maximize any space in your home no matter your preference. Our incredible selections are guaranteed to impress family and friends. Heritage We have been manufacturing fine linens for over 40 years. We make everything from towels and bathrobes, to comforters and mattress toppers, sheets, duvets, pillowcases, and bed skirts, and even area rugs. Our wide range of colors, patterns, and price points ensures that every one of our customers will be able to find something they'll love. We are experts in manufacturing high-quality textiles and pride ourselves on only producing the most beautiful products for our customers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81awd-GeoSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SUPERIOR","source_asin":"B07FZ7RDDS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-632803","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FZ7RDDS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FZ7RDDS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
