window.products.push({"id":632820,"name":"Abahub Premium Quality Anti Slip Rug Grippers 2' x 3' for Under Area Rugs Carpets Runners Doormats on Wood Hardwood Floors, Non Slip, Washable Padding","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HeSUXfdmL._AC_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM quality & DOUBLE thickness: Our non slip rug pads are twice as thick as a regular pad, which allows more rubber to grip the floor to provide enhanced performance in reducing slippery. Made of premium materials, these carpet pads are the best choice for keeping your rugs, carpets, runners in place. Floor PROTECTION: The extra thick material and open grid construction are able to absorb sudden pressure, so as to help protect your hardwood floors from damages by the rough surface on the underside of most rugs and carpets. SAFETY for your home: Keep your family or guests safe wherever and whenever needed with this rug pad, prevent a wrong step that would cause injury in your home. EASY installation and care: Our carpet pads come in 10 pre-cut sizes to suit most standard sized carpets; moreover, it’s easy to trim off any excess material, simply with a household scissor, to fit any unique sizes or shapes. Because of its sturdy construction, these rug pads are reversible, vacuum-friendly and ready to use right out of the package. 100% Customer Satisfaction GUARANTEE: If you’re less than 100% satisfied with our rug pad, simply send it back for a full refund or replacement. No questions asked! (*To Prevent Falls: Place on clean, dry floor and smooth wrinkles. Make sure rug lies flat and stays flat with use. Do not use rug pad on stairs. Not intended for use on carpet, vinyl, lacquered, acrylic, natural stone, porous, or refinished surfaces. )","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HeSUXfdmL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Abahub","source_asin":"B073B35S4L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-632820","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073B35S4L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B073B35S4L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":632821,"name":"Recipe Binder Book Organizer Keeper Kit 50 PCS Recipe Cards 10 Dividers 50 Plastic Sleeves 3 Ring 8.5 X 9.5 inch Gifts","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AfyM49rzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What you get- 1 pcs 3 ring recipe binder, made of cardboard, which measures 9.5\"*8.5\"*2\", 50 pcs recipe cards measure 4\"*6\", 10 pcs dividers, 50 pcs Page Protectors This recipe binder kit is a great way to organize your favorite recipes you make yourself, find online or pass down generations, it is a great gift choice for Thankgiving and Christmas Make Cooking Fun - Create a cooking list and get a sense of accomplishment! More free time, try new recipes. This recipe binder kit allows you to make the best of popular recipes or create your own, This is a really cute binder. The cover is sturdy and it comes with cute blank recipe cards and easy to wipe clean pockets. Has named dividers to organize recipes. Great way to keep recipes all in one place. Would make a nice gift. Cute Design and Good Quality - Recipe binder Cover is cute watercolour design of cooking utensils, colourful recipe cards ,a nice weight 300 GSM so ink doesn’t bleed through as easily. Space for recording recipe name, services for how many people, prep time, ingredients and directions. You also could write down when you cook this recipe and if it taste good, and some tips","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AfyM49rzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ceiba tree","source_asin":"B09MK92NRM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-632821","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MK92NRM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MK92NRM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":632822,"name":"LaMont Home Diamante Coverlet, Twin, Ivory","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91I2-7Wg90L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This elegant Portuguese matelassé from Lamont Home is an all over diamond design. Quapunto finished hem adds that extra touch. 100Percent cotton, and able to be machine washed with care, this bedding is sure to be a great addition to your home. Additional Lamont Home items - including bedding, hampers, bath accessories, and more are available from Lamont Home","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91I2-7Wg90L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LaMont Home","source_asin":"B009C85A2Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-632822","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B009C85A2Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B009C85A2Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":632823,"name":"INSE Cordless Vacuum Cleaner, 6 in 1 Powerful Stick Vacuum with 2200m-Ah Rechargeable Battery Up to 45Mins Long Runtime, Lightweight Vacuum Cleaner fo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nYbVJh2eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Max to12 Kpa Powerful Suction】Equipped with a 160W brushless motor, this cordless vacuum can offer outstanding and impressive 12Kpa suction on Max Mode, quickly picks up pet hair, dirt, debris, and messes from a variety of surfaces including hardwood floor, low and mid pile carpet, tile floor, marble floor, etc. Vacuum stick cordless has remarkable performance on both hardwood floors and low-pile rugs and carpets. Deep clean embedded dirt under furniture, protects floors from scratches. 【45mins Runtime & Long Battery Life】The battery-powered stick vacuum cleaner is equipped with a 2200mAh battery, which allows it to last up to 45 minutes of fade-free operation, picks up debris and dust, crumbs, and pet hairs, and is 5 times more durable than average batteries. You can charge the battery separately or charge the whole cordless vacuum based on its detachable battery design. 【5 High-Efficiency Filtration System】The filtration system of this cordless vacuum is completely sealed so that clean air and dust are separated without leakage. Moreover, it is equipped with a high-density HEPA filter that effectively cleans up 99.99% of microscopic dust particles down to 0.1 microns, thus preventing secondary pollution from entering the exhaust air. Simply open the release lock to empty the dustbin, protecting your hands from dirt. PS: HEPA is reusable and can be cleaned. 【Maneuverable LED Brush & Versatile Nozzles】The cordless vacuum cleaner features a floorhead with LED dust searchlight that illuminates every dark corner and helps to track dust. A combination of stiff nylon and soft nylon bristles are built into the vacuum: the stiff one for carpets (low pile) and the soft one with antistatic carbon fiber bristles for hard floors including tiles. Vacuum with its extension tube and multiple attachments, it can be used for cleaning from floor-to-ceiling surfaces 【Low-maintenance Cost and Easy to Assemble】This cordless vacuum keep your maintenance cost as low as possible. Simply cleaning the dust cup, and regularly washing and replacing the filters can help to maintain the performance and last the service life of your stick vacuum. And you can be assured that there is no problem with the installation because all the attachments are very easy to assemble and detach within seconds as long as following our User Manuel. 【Valuable Package & Great Customer Service】INSE vacuum cleaner, motorized brush head, stiff roller brush, soft roller brush, retractable metal tube, long crevice, oval brush for fabric surface, 2 HEPA filters, charging base with mains charger, 2-in-1 cleaning brush tools for cleaning hair from the roller, instruction manual, service card. We provide a 12-month warranty and 7/24 INSE customer service as well.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nYbVJh2eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"INSE","source_asin":"B0BJF7B22S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-632823","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJF7B22S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJF7B22S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":632824,"name":"ZINUS Desmond Upholstered Platform Bed Frame with Wingback Headboard / Mattress Foundation / Wood Slat Support / No Box Spring Needed / Easy Assembly,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71poqlMBUIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Embody the charm and sophistication of a quaint B&B right at home with our Desmond Upholstered Platform Bed. Its beautifully detailed, button-tufted headboard with squared-off wingbacks serves as a chic centerpiece for your master suite, guest room or loft bedroom. And its durable steel frame and wood platform have got your mattress covered. Simply rest any foam, latex or spring mattress directly on top, no box spring needed. And although this foundation’s looks are clearly sophisticated, rest assured that its assembly is not. Everything you need to assemble it in under an hour is skillfully packed into the back of its headboard compartment so all you need to bring with you is your own two hands. And we aim to bring you a product that’s no less than excellent, which is why it includes a 5-year worry-free warranty. But if you ask us, the best part about bringing home this classically comfortable bed is that reservations are never required.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71poqlMBUIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zinus","source_asin":"B08MQG7VQ4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-632824","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08MQG7VQ4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08MQG7VQ4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
