window.products.push({"id":632889,"name":"Fatapaese Satin Pillowcases Queen Size Set of 2, Black Pillow Cases for Hair and Skin 20x30 inches, Satin Cooling Pillow Covers with Envelope Closure","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mkD5tJomL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【High-quality Satin】Satin pillowcases are made of 100% polyester satin, which is post-processed in the process, and is anti-static and anti-spinning. Unlike pillowcases of other materials, satin has better elasticity and gloss and is stronger and more durable than silk pillowcases that require professional care 【Hair Care Secret】Satin pillow covers are anti-static, effectively preventing hair from knotting, so you don’t have to worry about your hairstyle the next day. Compared with sleeping on a cotton pillowcase, it can reduce friction on the hair and reduce hair breakage, and will not absorb moisture to help keep the hair shiny 【Skin Care Secret】Satin pillow cases provide your skin with a perfect sliding and smooth texture to protect your skin from facial sleep lines and reduce wrinkles. Reduce friction, keep skin soft and moisturized to make your face younger 【Humanized Design】The pillowcase with envelope closure prevents your hair from being entangled in your dreams. It helps you put in and take out the pillow more conveniently. Care tips: Turn over satin pillowcases, put them in a mesh laundry bag, and wash them in cold water with a mild detergent 【What You Can Get】Satin pillowcases set of 2 with envelope closure, which you can give as a Christmas/birthday gift to friends who need a good sleep. We provide efficient after-sales service to bring you a different shopping experience","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mkD5tJomL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fatapaese","source_asin":"B09B1WS7P1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-632889","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09B1WS7P1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09B1WS7P1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
